    <string name="kit_title">Nikon FM and Godox iM30</string>
    <string name="kit_intro">Manual flash math for this body and this flash. The meter in the FM does not read the iM30.</string>
    <string name="how_to_title">How to shoot</string>
    <string name="how_to_body">Set the film ISO here and on the FM ASA ring. Seat the iM30 fully on the hot shoe and leave S1/S2 off. Scroll the aperture dial on Camera and set the flash power the app shows. Use the ruler button above the dials for fixed distance, then scroll the distance dial. Shutter speed does not change the flash exposure. Use any sync speed, 1/125 or slower. At full power, wait about 3.6 seconds for recycle.</string>
